# Sagar Parab - Infrastructure Operating System

A premium personal portfolio for **Sagar Parab**, DevOps Engineer. Built as a single-page application that presents as a personal infrastructure operating system - cinematic preloader, interactive terminal, live GitHub intelligence, case-study projects, and an RCA research lab.

> **Design intent.** Every section has its own composition. No generic skill bars. No fabricated statistics. No fake testimonials. Every metric comes from the live GitHub API or is explicitly configured.

---

## ✦ Features

- 🚀 Cinematic SVG preloader with status cycle
- 🧭 Persistent side rails with scroll-spy and local time
- 💻 Functional Linux-style terminal (help / about / skills / projects / github / contact / clear)
- 🗺️ Interactive infrastructure command centre
- 🌌 Capability constellation with cluster filtering
- 🧩 Five in-depth project case studies with live architecture diagrams
- 📡 Real GitHub API integration with 1-hour cache
- 📊 Language distribution + top-repos-by-stars charts (Recharts)
- 📅 Versioned career mission log
- 🧪 RCA research lab with live demo dataset
- 📄 Resume console (with graceful fallback when PDF isn't attached)
- ✉️ Honest contact form (opens mail client - no fake "sent" states)
- ♿ Full keyboard navigation, ARIA labels, reduced-motion support
- 📱 Responsive down to 320 px
- 🎨 Custom cursor (desktop only, respects `prefers-reduced-motion`)

---

## 🛠️ Tech stack

- **Vite** + **React 19** + **TypeScript** (strict)
- **Tailwind CSS v4** (CSS-first config, `@theme` tokens)
- **Framer Motion** for animation
- **Recharts** for data visualisation
- **Lucide React** for icons
- **GitHub REST API** (unauthenticated, cached 1 h)

