## ⚙️ Configuration

All personal content lives in **`src/config/`**:

| File                  | Purpose                                                 |
| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |
| `portfolio.ts`        | Name, titles, bio, social links, availability, effects |
| `projects.ts`         | Full case-study projects with architecture              |
| `experience.ts`       | Career mission log + capability clusters + RCA methods  |

Update these files to personalise the portfolio. No other component stores personal content.

### Adding a project

Append to the `projects` array in `src/config/projects.ts`. Every field is typed. The UI will pick it up automatically.

### Adding a mission entry

Append to `missionLog` in `src/config/experience.ts`.

### Adding / tweaking an RCA method

Append to `rcaMethods` in `src/config/experience.ts`.

