## 🔐 Environment

Copy the example file:

```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

```env
# Optional - raises GitHub API rate limit from 60 to 5,000 req/hr.
# Do NOT commit a real token to version control.
VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN=

VITE_SITE_URL=https://sagarparab.dev
VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL=sagar.parab@example.com
```

The token, if set, is used only inside `src/lib/github.ts`. It is embedded at build time (Vite rule for `VITE_` vars). For a production deployment, prefer a small proxy (Cloudflare Worker, Vercel Edge Function) that injects the token server-side.

