## 🖼️ Replacing assets

### Resume

Place a PDF at `public/resume/sagar-parab-resume.pdf`, then in `src/config/portfolio.ts` set:

```ts
resume: {
  path: "/resume/sagar-parab-resume.pdf",
  available: true,
}
```

### Project screenshots

The case studies intentionally do not ship with placeholder screenshots - use the `highlights`, `architecture`, and `dataFlow` arrays to tell each story. If you add real screenshots later, extend the `Project` type with an optional `screenshots: string[]` field and render them in `ProjectMissionControl.tsx`.

