## 🌐 Deployment

### Vercel

```bash
vercel
```

The `dist/` folder contains a single `index.html` - no server required.

### Netlify / Cloudflare Pages / GitHub Pages

Point the build to `npm run build` with publish directory `dist`. Because everything is inlined into one HTML file, no special routing config is needed.

