## ♿ Accessibility

- Semantic landmarks (`main`, `nav`, `aside`, `section`, `footer`)
- Skip-to-content link
- Visible focus rings (`:focus-visible`)
- ARIA labels for all icon-only buttons
- Reduced-motion mode: animations collapse to 0.01 ms, preloader is instant, custom cursor disabled
- All charts have `<p class="sr-only">` text summaries
- Terminal supports Arrow Up/Down history, Tab completion, Ctrl+L clear

---

## 📊 Performance

- Single-file production build (~900 KB, ~260 KB gzipped)
- SVG logo, no raster images
- All animations use CSS transforms + opacity
- IntersectionObserver for scroll-spy and `whileInView`
- GitHub data cached in `localStorage` for 1 hour

